---

## 📌 Executive Summary

As a **Remote Medical VA**, I bridge the gap between patient onboarding and physician consultations. This repository provides interactive workflow diagrams, documentation templates, and standardized intake procedures designed to optimize clinic efficiency and reduce administrative load for healthcare providers.

---

## 🗂️ Core Competencies & Remote VA Services

| Service Area | Key Capabilities |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Patient Intake & Registration** | Demographic verification, insurance data collection, consent forms, EHR profile creation. |
| **Priority Triage & Screening** | Emergency Severity Index (ESI) classification, symptom intake, urgent escalation protocols. |
| **Medical Scribing & EHR** | SOAP note formatting, ICD-10 & CPT code mapping, chart pre-buffing, e-prescriptions draft. |
| **Administrative & Billing** | Insurance prior authorization, appointment scheduling, patient follow-up calls, claims tracking. |

